            "content": "<p>Learn more about sustainability <a href=\"/pages/sustainability\" title=\"Sustainability\">here</a>.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_dEtQXW": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Jet Lag Overnight Eye Serum vegan and cruelty-free?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, Summer Fridays products are not tested on animals or contain any animal by-products.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_wipdLf": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Jet Lag Overnight Eye Serum gluten-free?",
            "content": "<p>Jet Lag Overnight Eye Serum is formulated without gluten. It’s important to note that while all Summer Fridays products are formulated to be gluten-free, we cannot guarantee that they have been produced in a gluten-free facility. However, The National Celiac Association has stated that unless cosmetic products are ingested, there should not be an issue with gluten in topical products. <br/><br/>Please see <a href=\"https://nationalceliac.org/celiac-disease-questions/using-gluten-free-skin-body-products-someone-celiac-disease/\">here</a> for additional information. As always, if there is concern, we recommend that you consult with your physician/healthcare provider prior to use.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_PFnEJE": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Jet Lag Overnight Eye Serum non-comedogenic?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, Jet Lag Overnight Eye Serum is non-comedogenic, which means it will not clog pores.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_xY79XQ": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Jet Lag Overnight Eye Serum suitable for all skin types?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, Jet Lag Overnight Eye Serum is suitable for all skin types. If you have any concerns, we recommend that you ‘patch test’ prior to use.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_gceYb7": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "When can I expect to see results from Jet Lag Overnight Eye Serum?",
            "content": "<p>Clinical studies found that most users noticed results within 2-4 weeks of regular use.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_pRNF6B": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I use Jet Lag Overnight Eye Serum with other eye products?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, you can layer this eye serum with another eye cream as long as it does not have other active ingredients like AHA, BHA, or any other type of retinoid or exfoliant.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_JnyDJz": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can you pair Jet Lag Overnight Eye Serum with products that have AHA and BHA in them?",
            "content": "<p>No, this product should not be used at the same time as other products with other actives like AHA and BHA in effort to avoid any potential irritation. If you would like to incorporate both into your routine, we recommend using them on alternate nights.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        }
      },
